---
import RackExplorer from './RackExplorer.astro';
---
<section class="vision-section" id="vision" aria-labelledby="vision-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="vision-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Vision</p>
        <h2 id="vision-title">A data center<br />that works as one.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="vision-intro">
        <p class="vision-lead">Every watt has a constraint.<br />Every workload has a purpose.</p>
        <p>We're building toward a control layer that connects them. strided will bring power, hardware, kernels, runtimes, and scheduling into one system, with decisions guided by the workload and its limits.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="vision-rack" id="rack">
      <div class="rack-heading">
        <h3>Same rack. Different priorities.</h3>
        <p>Throughput, power, cost, and latency ask different things of the same hardware. Choose an objective to explore an illustrative allocation and its tradeoffs.</p>
      </div>
      <RackExplorer />
    </div>

    <dl class="vision-capabilities">
      <div><dt>Observe across layers.</dt><dd>Connect power, thermal, and runtime signals to the workload they affect. Build a shared view of cause and effect.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Choose with context.</dt><dd>Make power budgets, response-time limits, and cost per outcome explicit. Show what each decision improves and what it gives up.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Act with a record.</dt><dd>Keep changes bounded, reviewable, and reversible. Retain the evidence and compare the outcome with a reproducible baseline.</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="vision-direction">This is the system we're working toward. Our research today starts with causal diagnosis for LLM inference.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .vision-section { background: var(--paper-card); padding-block: var(--section-space); }
  .vision-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
  .vision-heading .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .vision-intro { padding-top: 42px; max-width: 520px; }
  .vision-lead { font: 400 27px/1.45 var(--font-display); letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .vision-intro > p:not(.vision-lead) { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.85; margin-top: 21px; }
  .vision-rack { margin-top: 64px; }
  .rack-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .rack-heading h3 { font-size: 29px; }
  .rack-heading > p { max-width: 520px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .vision-capabilities { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 56px; margin: 64px 0 0; }
  .vision-capabilities dt { font: 400 27px/1.2 var(--font-display); letter-spacing: -.015em; }
  .vision-capabilities dd { margin: 18px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.85; }
  .vision-direction { max-width: 720px; margin-top: 36px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  @media (max-width: 950px) { .vision-heading, .rack-heading { gap: 40px; } .vision-capabilities { gap: 32px; } }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .vision-heading, .rack-heading { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .vision-intro { padding-top: 0; }
    .vision-lead { font-size: 25px; }
    .vision-rack { margin-top: 44px; }
    .rack-heading { gap: 16px; }
    .vision-capabilities { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; margin-top: 44px; }
    .vision-capabilities dd { margin-top: 12px; }
  }
</style>
